<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - US Freightways.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - US Freightways.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of US Freightways Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- US Freightways gained 1/2 to 28-3/8.</p>
</text>
